# rena0-shot-recovery — F1-3 fixture, P2-7 charge family (the recovery refill)
#
# Source: the recovered air recovery (state 403, FUN_0043ffc0.c:2021-2040) adds 0x28 (40) to
# the shot gauge on every tick and clamps the result to 1000. (The 5-point form is the
# hit-status slot-6 branch.)
#
# The start value is a harness affordance, not a reachable original state: the product resets
# the gauge to 1000 and natural play rarely drops it, so the refill is only observable from
# below the cap. The scripted jump's launch tick carries the row-40 refill (+40, clamped),
# bringing the 900 start to 940 on tick 4 with no launch spend; the air recovery then
# refills +40/tick from tick 49 and clamps at 1000 on tick 50. What this fixture proves is
# the rule's rate and its clamp; jump-row durations beyond the port's single launch tick
# stay a named limit (PILOT-SEAM.md §30.6).
combo 0 0
seed 5489
spawn 0 0 0 0
spawn 1 0 0 300
collision open-field
hyper oyashiro
charge_gauge 400
input 0 SPECIAL
input 1 -
input 4 JUMP
input 5 -
input 10 SHOOT
input 11 -
expect 24 charge_gauge 640
expect 25 shot_bullet_row 7
expect 48 charge_gauge 1000
